 "title": "Single 2-input OR gate, TTL-level inputs, 4.5 V to 5.5 V",
 "source": {
  "revision": "SCLS320P, revised March 2024",
  "pages": 25
 },
 "summary": "One 2-input OR gate of the AHCT family (SN74AHCT1G32) for a 5 V supply: Y goes high when A or B is high. Its inputs switch at TTL levels (VIH 2 V, VIL 0.8 V), so a 3.3 V logic signal drives it and the output swings to the 5 V rail. The output sources and sinks 8 mA, quiescent supply current is 10 µA at most, and delay is 8 ns maximum into 15 pF from -40 °C to 85 °C. It comes in SOT-23 (DBV), SC-70 (DCK) and SOT-553 (DRL) five-pin packages, rated -40 °C to 125 °C.",
 "key_figures": [
